# Freemium

- Free plan: **2 drafts** max. Enforce in `saveDraft` and the studio “Новый” action.
- New drafts above the limit must not be written to `localStorage`. Show a Pro CTA instead.
- Every proposal sheet/PDF shows watermark `Собрано в Outframe · free` from `FREE_WATERMARK`.
- `/pro` price is **990 ₽/мес**. Waitlist is `mailto` via `WAITLIST_MAILTO` in `src/lib/plan.ts`.
- Keep plan numbers in `src/lib/plan.ts`. Do not hardcode a different limit or price.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
saveDraft(createProposal()); // even when 2 drafts already exist

// ✅ GOOD
if (!canCreateDraft()) return;
const next = saveDraft(createProposal());
```
